Shorts Studio

This repository is an original short-form marketing video system. It does not contain
source code, footage, characters, or the style bible from the project below.

The pipeline shape (a written script, timed captions, a Remotion composition at a
fixed frame size and frame rate, an ffmpeg audio mux, and an ffprobe quality gate)
is inspired by:

  claude-animated-shorts
  https://github.com/mromidev/claude-animated-shorts
